ection>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.hypot.hypot\"><h3><code>std.math.hypot.hypot</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L23\">源码行 23</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>返回 sqrt(x * x + y * y)，避免不必要的上溢和下溢。</p>\n<p>特殊情况：</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>x</th>\n<th>y</th>\n<th>hypot</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+-inf</td>\n<td>any</td>\n<td>+inf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>any</td>\n<td>+-inf</td>\n<td>+inf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nan</td>\n<td>fin</td>\n<td>nan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fin</td>\n<td>nan</td>\n<td>nan</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">hypot</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span>, y: <span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span>) <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x, y)</code></pre>\n<h4>用法示例</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> hypot {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expect\">expect</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/hypot/#std.math.hypot.hypot\">hypot</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0.3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0.4</span>) == <span class=\"tok-number\">0.5</span>);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.hypot.hypot_test_cases\"><h3><code>std.math.hypot.hypot_test_cases</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L84\">源码行 84</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.hypot.hypotFused\"><h3><code>std.math.hypot.hypotFused</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L63\">源码行 63</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">hypotFused</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> F: <span class=\"tok-ty